    "body": "`<base>` support is a nobrainer. The original gecko feature ticket people even wonders why not add `noopener` by default with opt-out instead https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1222516#c4\r\n\r\n\r\nThis will help when well behaved ads, for example, using regular `<a>` links to compromised landing pages. Won't help much if the actual ad is compromised though.",
