    "body": "I think adding the functionality is pretty reasonable. I don't have strong opinions about how exactly we spell it: `rel` or a boolean attribute both seem fine to me.\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, I'm not at all enthusiastic about extending `<base>`. If folks want the ability to set a default policy for a page or site, I hope we can align on some out-of-band mechanism instead (origin policy or feature policy seem like good targets).",
